msgstr "Trusted privileged management, not a user gateway action. Same serialized lifecycle executor as dispatch/join, except synchronous identity/copy callbacks may request close. This is not a general concurrent cross-task control API. Close is permanent; it does not close the underlying owner. No worker or provider service runs here. Keep driving the owner and authenticate POLL/CONSUME through normal dispatch. Identity/copy callbacks may request close, never recursively dispatch or reconstruct. All bound storage stays live."

