msgstr "Construct one serialized privileged Thread owner without MMIO writes."

msgid "Exact STM32U575ZIT6Q TZEN0/MSIS4/MSIK4/equal buses/Range4 and selected SRAM4 only. LPDMA1EN/SRAM4EN and power/retention belong to selected startup; every channel and vector must initially be quiet. The run-gate owner keeps both gates and exclusive hardware configuration stable through stop and joins; no other LPDMA channel may start. This component owns only fixed sleep/autonomous bits and preserves unrelated RTC bits. SRAM4EN and power/retention preconditions belong to startup and the combined sleep owner. This component never repairs lost RAM by changing SRAM4PD/PDS and never disables the caller's SRAM4EN."
msgstr "Exact STM32U575ZIT6Q TZEN0/MSIS4/MSIK4/equal buses/Range4 and selected SRAM4 only. LPDMA1EN/SRAM4EN and power/retention belong to selected startup; every channel and vector must initially be quiet. The run-gate owner keeps both gates and exclusive hardware configuration stable through stop and joins; no other LPDMA channel may start. This component owns only fixed sleep/autonomous bits and preserves unrelated RTC bits. SRAM4EN and power/retention preconditions belong to startup and the combined sleep owner. This component never repairs lost RAM by changing SRAM4PD/PDS and never disables the caller's SRAM4EN."

msgid "[inout] Fresh zero or clean stopped and externally joined."
msgstr "[inout] Fresh zero or clean stopped and externally joined."

msgid "[in] Separate immutable clock/owner binding."
msgstr "[in] Separate immutable clock/owner binding."

msgid "[out] Separate writable immutable face, unchanged on failure."
msgstr "[out] Separate writable immutable face, unchanged on failure."

msgid "Prepare copied metadata in an unborrowed request, without MMIO."
msgstr "Prepare copied metadata in an unborrowed request, without MMIO."

msgid "Rejecting a span, alias, wrap or state leaves every request byte unchanged. Preparation does not borrow or write any buffer/workspace. Old Core TIM2 deadlines are never translated into this domain."
msgstr "Rejecting a span, alias, wrap or state leaves every request byte unchanged. Preparation does not borrow or write any buffer/workspace. Old Core TIM2 deadlines are never translated into this domain."

